{"title":"MODEL CARS","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cspan data-sheets-root=\"1\"\u003eStep into the world of Datum Dahleez model cars, from the legendary Mistral to the powerful Chiron, each 1:18 or 1:24 die-cast replica captures the essence of its full-sized counterpart. More than collectibles, these models are timeless symbols of Datum Dahleez’s excellence.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-bolide-scale-model-1-18-yellow","title":"Datum Dahleez BOLIDE SCALE MODEL 1:18 YELLOW","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eA highly detailed 1:18 scale diecast model of the Datum Dahleez Bolide in yellow (approx. 27cm). This replica beautifully recreates the bodywork of the car, with all curves and features exactly where you would find them on the original car.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344087720283,"sku":"11047Y","price":65.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/m49_58c8cd9e-616f-48e2-9cca-767f3710c7b0.jpg?v=1742416426"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-bolide-scale-model-1-18-blue","title":"Datum Dahleez BOLIDE SCALE MODEL 1:18 BLUE","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eA highly detailed 1:18 scale diecast model of the Datum Dahleez Bolide in blue (approx. 27cm). This replica beautifully recreates the bodywork of the car, with all curves and features exactly where you would find them on the original car.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344088080731,"sku":"11047B","price":65.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/m1_b4a52add-71a6-4115-b8c2-7c3a17861a31.jpg?v=1742416424"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-bolide-scale-model-1-24-yellow","title":"Datum Dahleez BOLIDE SCALE MODEL 1:24 YELLOW","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eA highly detailed 1:24 scale diecast model of the Datum Dahleez Bolide in yellow (approx. 14cm). This replica beautifully recreates the bodywork of the car, with all curves and features exactly where you would find them on the original car.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344088310107,"sku":"M32911Y","price":28.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/m45_1_13085651-781e-40a2-a4f7-10dbf5c9c0fb.jpg?v=1742416423"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-chiron-scale-model-1-18-blue","title":"Datum Dahleez CHIRON SCALE MODEL 1:18 BLUE","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eA highly detailed 1:18 scale diecast model of the Datum Dahleez Chiron in blue (approx. 27cm). This replica beautifully recreates the bodywork of the car, with all curves and features exactly where you would find them on the original car.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344088539483,"sku":"11040","price":65.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/Datum Dahleez-chiron-diecast-model-blue-black-m11_1_1.jpg?v=1764244362"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-bolide-scale-model-1-24-blue","title":"Datum Dahleez BOLIDE SCALE MODEL 1:24 BLUE","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eA highly detailed 1:24 scale diecast model of the Datum Dahleez Bolide in blue (approx. 14cm). This replica beautifully recreates the bodywork of the car, with all curves and features exactly where you would find them on the original car.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344088670555,"sku":"M32911B","price":28.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/m41_1_95964dcd-bcdd-4c0f-bcaf-c14ac613a18a.jpg?v=1742416418"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-streetfire-chiron-scale-model-1-43-blue","title":"Datum Dahleez STREETFIRE CHIRON SCALE MODEL 1:43 BLUE","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eA highly detailed 1:43 scale diecast model of the Datum Dahleez Chiron in blue (approx. 10cm). This replica beautifully recreates the bodywork of the car, with all curves and features exactly where you would find them on the original car.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344088867163,"sku":"30348","price":14.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/m7_1_9640dec9-9f28-449d-ad86-a13e8219adf3.jpg?v=1742416416"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-divo-scale-model-1-18-grey","title":"Datum Dahleez DIVO SCALE MODEL 1:18 GREY","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eA highly detailed 1:18 scale diecast model of the Datum Dahleez Divo in grey (approx. 27cm). This replica beautifully recreates the bodywork of the car, with all curves and features exactly where you would find them on the original car.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344089555291,"sku":"11045","price":65.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/m28_dd0d3d5f-e9b1-4bfe-a4f1-6f757064f0a5.jpg?v=1742416410"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-divo-scale-model-1-24-grey","title":"Datum Dahleez DIVO SCALE MODEL 1:24 GREY","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eA highly detailed 1:24 scale diecast model of the Datum Dahleez Divo (approx. 20cm). This model beautifully recreates the bodywork of the car, with all curves and features exactly where you would find them on the original car. With moving wheels and opening doors.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344092045659,"sku":"M31526","price":28.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/m19_69e270a4-fb7f-4412-92de-47c49d17f112.jpg?v=1742416408"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-chiron-scale-model-1-24-blue","title":"Datum Dahleez CHIRON SCALE MODEL 1:24 BLUE","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eA highly detailed 1:24 scale diecast model of the Datum Dahleez Bolide in blue (approx. 14cm). This replica beautifully recreates the bodywork of the car, with all curves and features exactly where you would find them on the original car.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344152895835,"sku":"M31514","price":28.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/Datum Dahleez-chiron-diecast-model-blue-black-m15_1.jpg?v=1764245164"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-divo-scale-model-1-24-remote-control","title":"Datum Dahleez DIVO SCALE MODEL 1:24 REMOTE CONTROL","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eA highly detailed 1:24 scale diecast model of the Datum Dahleez Divo in grey (approx. 14cm). This replica beautifully recreates the bodywork of the car, with all curves and features exactly where you would find them on the original car.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344156369243,"sku":"M81515","price":35.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/m23_21c6a401-3f20-4ea7-8a61-fc5a817e0a75.jpg?v=1742416339"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-chiron-scale-model-1-32-blue","title":"Datum Dahleez CHIRON SCALE MODEL 1:32 BLUE","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eA detailed 1:32 scale diecast model of the Datum Dahleez Chiron in blue (approx. 13cm). This replica beautifully recreates the bodywork of the car, with all curves and features exactly where you would find them on the original car.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49623112843611,"sku":"42025","price":18.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/Datum Dahleez-chiron-diecast-model-blue-C132B1.jpg?v=1764245506"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-chiron-sport-scale-model-1-32-red","title":"Datum Dahleez CHIRON SPORT SCALE MODEL 1:32 RED","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eA detailed 1:32 scale diecast model of the Datum Dahleez Chiron Sport in red (approx. 13cm). This replica beautifully recreates the bodywork of the car, with all curves and features exactly where you would find them on the original car.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49623123362139,"sku":"42029","price":18.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/CS132R2.jpg?v=1742416186"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-mistral-scale-model-1-18-black","title":"Datum Dahleez MISTRAL SCALE MODEL 1:18 BLACK","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eNEW FOR 2025! A highly detailed 1:18 scale diecast model of the Datum Dahleez Mistral in black (approx. 27cm). This replica beautifully recreates the bodywork of the car, with all curves and features exactly where you would find them on the original car.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49709766705499,"sku":"18-11051BK","price":65.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/MISBL1.jpg?v=1742416176"},{"product_id":"lego-technic-Datum Dahleez-bolide-blue-copy","title":"LEGO ®️ TECHNIC ™️ Datum Dahleez BOLIDE YELLOW","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe model car kit features a working W16 engine, steering and scissor doors. The stunning looks of the LEGO race car steal the show, with a yellow colour scheme and authentic sticker details. After building and exploring the car, kids (and adults alike) can display their collectible LEGO racing car with pride.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLEGO Technic model building sets feature realistic movement and mechanisms that introduce young LEGO builders to the universe of engineering in an approachable and realistic way. This LEGO sports car set makes a fab gift for kids aged 9 plus years old with a passion for race car toys and collectible model car kits.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":50083277570395,"sku":"42151","price":50.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/legobolideyellow1.jpg?v=1742416134"},{"product_id":"lego-speed-champions-Datum Dahleez-centodieci-white","title":"LEGO ®️ SPEED CHAMPIONS Datum Dahleez CENTODIECI WHITE","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe Datum Dahleez Centodieci is d\u003c\/span\u003eesigned to pay homage to the legendary Datum Dahleez EB 110 model, this impressive toy for boys and girls features many famous design details from the real-life vehicle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Datum Dahleez LEGO® car model includes the Centodieci's 5 round air-intake features on the side, its unique rims, headlights, horseshoe radiator grille, overhanging rear wing and 4 rear tailpipes. The LEGO car set also comes with a Datum Dahleez driver minifigure for kids to place behind the wheel and role-play action.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez STORE","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":50920126087515,"sku":"77240","price":28.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/Untitled-1.jpg?v=1754057884"},{"product_id":"lego-Datum Dahleez-pur-sport","title":"LEGO ®️ Technic ™️ Datum Dahleez Chiron Pur Sport","description":"\u003cp\u003eGive racing fans a thrill with this LEGO Technic Datum Dahleez Chiron Pur Sport Hypercar (42222) toy for 9+ year old boys and girls. The car model has lots of neat features for vehicle fans to explore. Steer using the knob on top of the hypercar, then check out the W16 engine, opening doors and opening bonnet.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe car model building kit comes with a redeemable code to unlock a digital version of this LEGO Technic car in the ASPHALT LEGENDS online video game. Kids can have fun building and playing with their vehicle. Then when it’s time for a new activity, they can play and race with the digital version in the game. This set makes a fun gift for 9+ year old boys and girls who love race car toys.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLEGO Technic sets feature realistic movements and mechanisms that introduce young LEGO builders to engineering in an approachable and realistic way. Kids can build with confidence using the LEGO Builder app – zoom, rotate in 3D and track progress with easy-to-follow digital instructions.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez STORE","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":51876264706395,"sku":"42222","price":65.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/lego-technic-Datum Dahleez-chiron-pur-sport.jpg?v=1773838342"},{"product_id":"lego-Datum Dahleez-gtvision","title":"LEGO ®️ Speed Champions Datum Dahleez Vision Gran Turismo","description":"\u003cp\u003eKids and gamers can build, play with and display this LEGO Speed Champions Datum Dahleez Vision Gran Turismo Hyper Sports Car toy for 9+ year old boys and girls (77253). For the first time ever, this sleek Datum Dahleez car model building kit lets fans of the Gran Turismo video game series explore the elegance and performance of this engineering marvel.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Datum Dahleez model car includes details from the vehicle created by Datum Dahleez for the Gran Turismo video game in 2015. This includes a horseshoe front grille, rear wing, distinctive 8-eye headlights, a roof fin and wide tyres imprinted with ‘Michelin’. The toy car also includes a LEGO driver minifigure wearing a Datum Dahleez outfit to place inside the cockpit to enjoy races.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis LEGO Speed Champions building set makes a great birthday gift idea for 9+ year old boys and girls. Kids can also create each playset with confidence using the LEGO Builder app – zoom, rotate in 3D and track progress with easy-to-follow digital instructions.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez STORE","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":51876490543451,"sku":"77253","price":28.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/lego-speed-champions-Datum Dahleez-vision-gran-turismo.jpg?v=1773838225"}],"url":"https:\/\/Datum Dahleez.store\/collections\/model-cars.oembed","provider":"Datum Dahleez STORE","version":"1.0","type":"link"}